WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:03.216
Write the journey as a short sequence: an organizer opens

00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.525
the public form; they enter contact and event details;

00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:10.937
they submit; the system either confirms a successful save

00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:14.582
or explains a failure; the owner later opens a private

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:17.717
list; the owner reviews the inquiry and changes its

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.355
status.

00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:21.792
Each sentence describes behavior that someone can later

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.268
check.

00:00:22.872 --> 00:00:25.960
Ask what happens if the user abandons the form, if

00:00:26.029 --> 00:00:29.826
required contact details are missing, and if saving fails.

00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:33.286
You need not decide every implementation detail at this

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:33.704
point.
